# Portal ship: Prettier + PR template

Keep **Prettier** as the only code formatter for FactoryWager root/portal work. Do not invent or switch to Biome/oxfmt/dprint for these paths.

## Before commit (touched TypeScript)

On any changed harness/portal TS (especially `lib/portal/**/*.ts`, and when touching related `tools/` / `scripts/`):

```bash
bun x prettier --write <file>…
# or broader harness write:
bun run format:harness
```

Then re-stage. Prefer check before push:

```bash
bun x prettier --check <file>…
```

`format` / `format:harness` / `format:check*` are the same Prettier — different globs only.

## Pull requests

PR bodies **must** follow [`.github/pull_request_template.md`](.github/pull_request_template.md).

- Include filled **Claim → evidence** table (`unit` | `boundary` | `journey` | `deployed`) — gated by `bun scripts/check-pr-claim.ts`.
- Include Checklist, Test plan, Notes for reviewers as in the template.
- **Do not** use the Cursor user-rule Summary/Test-plan-only HEREDOC as the PR body.

Validate locally:

```bash
gh pr view <n> --json body -q .body | bun scripts/check-pr-claim.ts --stdin --strict
```
